{"name":"Submersible","hex":"#00576e","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"submersible","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Able to be submerged."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A small nonmilitary, nonnuclear submarine for exploration.","A retroactive term used for nonnuclear submarines; nuclear submarines are termed true submarines."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/submersible"}],"entries":[{"title":"Submersible","blocks":[{"text":"A submersible is an underwater vehicle which needs to be transported and supported by a larger watercraft or platform. This distinguishes submersibles from submarines, which are self-supporting and capable of prolonged independent operation at sea."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Submersible_named_Star_III_in_front_of_Scripps_Institution_of_Oceanography.JPG/330px-Submersible_named_Star_III_in_front_of_Scripps_Institution_of_Oceanography.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Submersible","wikidata":"Q1570255"},{"title":"Submersible (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Submersible is a 2020 Ecuadorian thriller drama film directed by Alfredo León León. It was selected as the Ecuadorian entry for the Best International Feature Film at the 94th Academy Awards."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/14/Submersible_%28film%29_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Submersible_(film)","wikidata":"Q108485549"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/54/Ictineu_3_submersible.JPG/500px-Ictineu_3_submersible.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/54/Ictineu_3_submersible.JPG/1280px-Ictineu_3_submersible.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thu